    splashText = "A postcard meant for another city brings Aishe to Toronto, where unfamiliar winters and the Iron Praxis demand that she begin again. She earns recognition, builds a haven and clientele, adapts prophecy to computers and changing media, and makes herself useful through blackouts, public fear, protests, and court petitions. By 2016, the stranger has become an established voice in a city nearing its next upheaval.",
